          "file": "main.tex",
          "excerptDigest": "sha256-618ea67fc7296fe21bd392a72ee91ad2fff62332c05f270fc0ce80ffe2242455"
        }
      ],
      "status": "active"
    },
    {
      "id": "claim-version:8d4c7fe5-97fa-49c9-8345-3ae63694a581",
      "claimId": "claim:0259266b-590b-4191-bda8-20d2609add8d",
      "targetVersionId": "target-version:5bf98b5b-cfef-47a7-b239-c471a3076520",
      "anchor": {
        "file": "main.tex",
        "from": 851,
        "to": 855,
        "excerptDigest": "sha256-d5223af7deacc7e8f66b014d3bd07de271696d7570d4c5163dbbc7eefb8c15eb"
      },
      "text": "Per-step arithmetic cost O~((|Omega_t| m) k + k^omega) = O~(|Omega_t| n^2 k^2 eps^{-2} log(n/eta) + k^omega).",
      "normalizedTextDigest": "sha256-61dd9b0c65a3a42afb5c3e794810d8cab8fb2f75331cad2e1de2a12d06f1e622",
      "kind": "time",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "file": "main.tex",
          "from": 851,
          "to": 855,
          "excerptDigest": "sha256-d5223af7deacc7e8f66b014d3bd07de271696d7570d4c5163dbbc7eefb8c15eb"
        }
      ],
      "status": "active"
    },
    {
      "id": "claim-version:1cba55e6-b11a-4255-a976-a3cb9f901f72",
      "claimId": "claim:866ad3ac-467d-4f77-bd67-37393a7f9af6",
      "targetVersionId": "target-version:5bf98b5b-cfef-47a7-b239-c471a3076520",
      "anchor": {
        "file": "main.tex",
        "excerptDigest": "sha256-ee820afb397dacafa5f09d072dd189efc1916d201796eda2341e190397e96b54"
      },
      "text": "Sparsify's own guarantee: at most m = O(d log d / delta^2 log(1/eta)) nonzeros, a (1 +- delta) ell_1 embedding with probability >= 1 - eta, in O~(Nd + d^omega) arithmetic operations for delta in (0,1/2) and omega <= 2.4.",
      "normalizedTextDigest": "sha256-201b6b1d7b74ccc6da084f0d013cf86bc861595b309c2824e2418b93df13c7bc",
      "kind": "other",
      "evidence": [
